    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to staffing standards for\nemployees performing emergency medical services in the 911 system in a city\nwith a population of over one million people",
    "basePrintNo": "S6698",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6698-2025",
